WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.334
-Tracy Morgan, everybody.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:04.767
Stick around. We'll be right
back with more "Tonight Show."

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:06.701
That is the name.
We did the name of the book.

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:07.968
[ Hip-hop music plays ]

00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:16.701
♪♪

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:20.200
-Yo, I seen your
"Finding My Roots," man.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.801
You made me cry.
-Thank you.

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:23.634
-Mines come on
February 20th.

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:25.200
-Did you cry?
-Yeah, I broke down.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.634
It don't matter who you are,
You going to break down?

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:29.701
They went back 400 years
in my family, man.

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:30.868
-Wow.
Wow.

00:00:30.868 --> 00:00:32.033
-Really?
Yeah, man. Yeah.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.934
Quest's family was found out,
they were the --

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:36.267
on the last slave ship
brought here.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.667
His family.
-Yeah.

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:39.067
You got to watch that movie --
that show.

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:42.167
I mean, they have black --
black celebrities do it.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:45.200
White celebrities, everybody,
you find out who you are.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.767
And, like, when I got hit
by that truck,

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:48.767
I wanted to know who I am
before I leave this.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.434
-Henry Louis Gates,
right, that's the host?

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:52.067
-Yeah.
-Oh, yeah. Man.

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:53.501
-Skip.
Skip was great.

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:55.434
I mean, you should check out
his "Finding My Roots."

00:00:55.434 --> 00:00:56.767
-Yeah.
-I will see that.

00:00:56.767 --> 00:00:59.200
-It was very, very --
Oprah did it.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.701
-Yeah.
-Barack did it.

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:02.234
-I want to do it.
-A lot of people did it.

00:01:02.234 --> 00:01:03.367
-I want to do it, but I want...
-You should try.

00:01:03.367 --> 00:01:04.701
They would love
to have you on, man.

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:06.300
It was two hours long.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.801
And they give you
a book of life,

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.334
and they go back
on your father's side

00:01:09.334 --> 00:01:10.801
and your mother's side,
400 years.

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:13.300
Yeah. Really?
So I know -- And guess who --

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.300
Guess who I found out.
-What?

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.400
-you know, the last --
the last thing they say

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.634
they want to know
who you're related to

00:01:18.634 --> 00:01:19.667
that did this show,
right?

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:20.934
-Right.
-They asked you that, too.

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.100
-Yeah.
-And he said,

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:23.334
"Would you turn the last page,
Mr. Morgan?"

00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:25.667
And I turn the page
guess who's sitting there.

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:27.534
My third cousin
on my mother's side -- Nas.

00:01:27.534 --> 00:01:28.601
-Oh, yeah?

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:30.701
-Esco's my third cousin.
-I believe that.

00:01:30.701 --> 00:01:32.133
-So, on the way back home,
I called him.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:33.501
I said, "Guess what.
I did 'Finding My Roots.'"

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:36.534
He said, "I did it, too."
I said, "Me and you related."

00:01:36.534 --> 00:01:38.501
He started crying.
I started crying.

00:01:38.501 --> 00:01:40.501
And I said, "If you ever
need me, cuz, I'm there."

00:01:40.501 --> 00:01:42.934
He said, "If you ever need me,
cuz, I'm there, right there."

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:45.200
But me and him was close anyway
because I did that

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.501
Comedy Central special
called "One Mic."

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:49.234
And that was because
his moms had passed away

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:50.667
and I dedicated
that to them.

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.033
-Oh, okay.
-Wow.

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:54.467
-To him and his mom, because
I'm really tight with Nas.

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:56.100
He's a really good man, too.
-He's a good dude.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.734
-Yeah. He's righteous.
-I like Nas.

00:01:57.734 --> 00:01:58.968
-Yeah.
I love you too, man.

00:01:58.968 --> 00:01:59.968
-I love you, too.

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.567
-I mean,
me and you go way back.

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:03.934
Me and you go back like
spinal cords and car seats.

00:02:03.934 --> 00:02:05.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:08.934
We go way back.
Spinal cords and car seats.

00:02:08.934 --> 00:02:12.067
That's my guy.
He's my younger brother.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:13.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.467 --> 00:02:15.467
From a different mother
with a different color.

00:02:15.467 --> 00:02:17.968
-You found that out
on "Finding My Roots"?

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:19.167
-We...
-We love --

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:21.534
We could have put all
this funny on TV, man.

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:22.901
-We can air this.
-When me and him be --

00:02:22.901 --> 00:02:24.501
Like, when we have fun,
we just be --

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:27.534
It'll just be me and him.
We be in a zone.

00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:30.167
I mean y'all, y'all are great.
We love y'all.

00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:32.300
Y'all -- Y'all time, you give us
a time and everything.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.901
But me and him
just be messing around.

00:02:34.901 --> 00:02:37.667
-But do you remember
you gave me the limo ride?

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:40.801
-When I -- He wasn't even
on "Saturday Night Live," yet.

00:02:40.801 --> 00:02:42.133
He was just a fan.

00:02:42.133 --> 00:02:43.534
And I was going
to the after party

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:44.968
after the "Saturday Night Live."

00:02:44.968 --> 00:02:47.300
And he was just like, "Yo, could
I ride in the limo with you?"

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.667
And I said, "Come on."
Him and his dad

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:50.033
and his mom
got in the limo with me.

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:51.200
-What?

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.534
-The next year he was on
"Saturday Night Live."

00:02:52.534 --> 00:02:54.100
-No, dude, for real.
I was at "Saturday Night Live,"

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.434
and I was -- I go,

00:02:55.434 --> 00:02:57.334
I don't know if I asked
to get into your limousine.

00:02:57.334 --> 00:02:59.067
I was just like freaking out
that it was you.

00:02:59.067 --> 00:03:01.200
I'm a fan. So I was like,
"Oh, my God, how you doing?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.300
Nice to meet you."
And you go,

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.534
"You going to the party?"

00:03:03.534 --> 00:03:05.434
And I go,
"We might if we can go."

00:03:05.434 --> 00:03:06.467
-Let's go.
-You go, "I'll give you a ride.

00:03:06.467 --> 00:03:07.834
Let's go right now.
Get in mine."

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:10.534
So me and my mom and my dad
got in your limousine

00:03:10.534 --> 00:03:12.601
and went and sat
with Tracy Morgan at SNL.

00:03:12.601 --> 00:03:13.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:15.634
-Now look at his life.
-The rest is history.

